@startuml Linkwise_Session_State
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #2A9D8F
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EFF5F8
  BorderColor #2E6F95
  FontColor #16324F
}

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Observing : refresh / snapshot
Observing --> Ranked : eligible candidates + evidence
Ranked --> Preparing : selected candidate / acquire lease
Preparing --> Prepared : verified readback / handle issued
Preparing --> Faulted : partial write / unsafe ambiguity
Prepared --> Authorizing : session requested / revalidate
Prepared --> Idle : expiry / cancel / release lease
Authorizing --> Ready : automatic local grant + interlocks pass
Authorizing --> Ranked : denied / stale; agent refreshes and re-ranks
Ready --> Active : client session begins
Ready --> Faulted : readiness or PTT invariant fails
Active --> Completing : client reports terminal state
Active --> Aborting : autonomous abort / deadline / fault / lease loss
Completing --> Idle : release observed / persist outcome
Aborting --> Idle : release observed / persist abort
Aborting --> Faulted : release cannot be confirmed
Faulted --> Reconciling : autonomous recovery / restart reconciliation
Reconciling --> Idle : safe state verified; controls remain gated
Reconciling --> Faulted : state unknown or PTT stuck
Idle --> EmergencyStopped : human emergency stop
Observing --> EmergencyStopped : human emergency stop
Ranked --> EmergencyStopped : human emergency stop
Preparing --> EmergencyStopped : human emergency stop
Prepared --> EmergencyStopped : human emergency stop
Authorizing --> EmergencyStopped : human emergency stop
Ready --> EmergencyStopped : human emergency stop
Active --> EmergencyStopped : human emergency stop
Completing --> EmergencyStopped : human emergency stop
Aborting --> EmergencyStopped : human emergency stop
Faulted --> EmergencyStopped : human emergency stop
Reconciling --> EmergencyStopped : human emergency stop
EmergencyStopped --> [*] : latched; offline maintenance required

note right of Active
  Modem key-up requests pass through the
  local PTT arbiter and bounded permit.
  Model/network availability is not on
  the release/watchdog path.
end note
note bottom of Faulted
  No new transmit session until safe state
  and release are confirmed; autonomous recovery
  only, otherwise remain latched safe.
end note
note right of EmergencyStopped
  Human runtime actuator is emergency stop only.
  Hardware transmit inhibit is independent of AI
  and application/network availability.
end note
@enduml
